---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Support the Project" description="Varve is built by one developer. Financial support via GitHub Sponsors enables platform support, stability work, and new features. Non-financial contributions are equally valuable.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="support-project-page">
      <h1>Support the Project</h1>
      <p class="support-intro">
        Varve is built by one developer. Your support enables continued development, platform support, and stability improvements.
      </p>

      <section class="support-section">
        <h2>Why Support Matters</h2>
        <p>
          As a solo-developer project, Varve relies on community support to continue development. Financial support enables platform support, stability work, and features that might otherwise be deferred.
        </p>
        <p>
          Non-financial contributions—testing, documentation, design, translations—are equally valuable and enable the project to grow in ways that money cannot.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="support-section">
        <h2>What Support Enables</h2>
        <div class="support-grid">
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>Platform Support</h3>
            <p>Linux ARM support, Windows ARM support, expanded Linux distribution testing</p>
          </div>
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>Feature Development</h3>
            <p>Complex script shaping, real-time collaboration transport, canvas bleed visualization</p>
          </div>
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>Stability Work</h3>
            <p>Bug fixes, performance optimization, accessibility improvements</p>
          </div>
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
            <p>CI/CD improvements, automated testing, code signing, checksums</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="support-section">
        <h2>Sponsorship</h2>
        <p>
          Support Varve through GitHub Sponsors. There is no paid edition, and
          sponsorship does not buy features, early builds, or support
          contracts — it keeps development funded and pays for the work that
          benefits every user. What you can expect in return is recognition
          and transparency.
        </p>

        <div class="tier-grid">
          <div class="tier-card">
            <h3>Bronze</h3>
            <p class="tier-price">$5-10/month</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Name listed in the supporters section of each release's notes (with your permission)</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/K-Arthur" class="btn-secondary">Sponsor</a>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-card">
            <h3>Silver</h3>
            <p class="tier-price">$25-50/month</p>
            <ul>
              <li>All Bronze benefits</li>
              <li>A larger entry with a link to your site or project</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/K-Arthur" class="btn-secondary">Sponsor</a>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-card featured">
            <h3>Gold</h3>
            <p class="tier-price">$100-500/month</p>
            <ul>
              <li>All Silver benefits</li>
              <li>Featured placement in the supporters section</li>
              <li>A direct conversation about what to build next</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/K-Arthur" class="btn-primary">Sponsor</a>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-card">
            <h3>Corporate</h3>
            <p class="tier-price">$500+/month</p>
            <ul>
              <li>All Gold benefits</li>
              <li>Company logo in the supporters section</li>
              <li>A conversation about your team's needs and what Varve should build for them</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/K-Arthur" class="btn-secondary">Sponsor</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="one-time-note">One-time support is also welcome and appreciated.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="support-section">
        <h2>Non-Financial Contribution</h2>
        <p>
          You don't need to contribute financially to help Varve. Non-financial contributions are equally valuable:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Testing:</strong> Test on different platforms and report bugs</li>
          <li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Improve docs, write tutorials, translate content</li>
          <li><strong>Design:</strong> Create UI mockups, icons, website improvements</li>
          <li><strong>Code:</strong> Fix bugs, add features, improve performance</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={sitePath('/contribute')} class="btn-secondary">Learn How to Contribute</a>
      </section>

      <section class="support-section">
        <h2>Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          Support funds are used for development work, and how they are spent
          is discussed openly in GitHub Discussions. Supporters are
          acknowledged in release notes (with their permission). If you have
          questions about how funds are used, ask in GitHub Discussions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="support-cta">
        <h2>Ready to support?</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/K-Arthur" class="btn-primary">Become a Sponsor on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-project-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .support-project-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .support-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .support-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .support-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .support-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .support-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .support-section strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(250px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .support-item {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .support-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-item p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .tier-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(220px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .tier-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  
  .tier-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface-accent-soft) 0%, var(--surface-card) 100%);
  }
  
  .tier-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .tier-price {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-link);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tier-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .tier-card li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .tier-card li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  
  .one-time-note {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  
  .support-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  
  .support-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
